            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyonu, adının ardından parantezleri <code>()</code> kullanarak çağır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display_cash\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  money = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  currency = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Euros&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{money}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" Euros&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display_cash()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"96\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"100 Euros\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>display_cash()</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
