            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyon adını snake case biçiminde ve parametreyi ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_ten_to\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(number)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(number + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"add_ten_to(\" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"add ten to\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"25\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>add_ten_to</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>number</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyona on eklemeyi snake case ile anlatan bir ad ver. Kodun <code>25</code> yazdırması için parametresini ve çağrısını tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_ten_to\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(number)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(number + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"add_ten_to(\" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"add ten to\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"value\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"25\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>add_ten_to</code>, ardından <code>number</code>, <code>add_ten_to</code> ve son olarak <code>15</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
